{#
	Shared project renderer: the single project markup used by the project page
	(`layouts/project.njk`), the homepage (`index.njk`), and the archive page
	(`proyectos.njk`). Everything project-specific comes from the view model
	(`lib/project-view.js`); galleries are rendered by the `gallery` shortcode,
	which owns all media markup.

	Included once per surface (an include inside a loop cannot host the async
	image shortcodes), so this partial renders every listed project.

	The three-column layout renders one ordered gallery split in half by the
	view model (`splitAt`): the first column takes the first half rounded up,
	the second column takes the rest.

	The title and the bilingual text come from the `projectTitle` and
	`projectBody` macros (`partials/project-content.njk`), so both variants
	share one copy of that markup.

	Context:
		projects — project view models, in display order
		heading  — title tag: "h1" on a project page, "h2" on a listing page
		linked   — link the title to its project page (listing pages)
		priority — load the first gallery image of the first project eagerly (LCP)
#}
{% from "partials/project-content.njk" import projectTitle, projectBody -%}
{% set projectHeading = heading or "h2" %}
{% for project in projects %}
{% if project.variant == "three-column" %}
	<article class="project project--three-column">
		<div class="project-three">
			<div class="project-three__col">
				{{ projectTitle(project, projectHeading, linked) }}
				{% gallery project.gallery.slice(0, project.splitAt) %}
			</div>
			<div class="project-three__col">
				<div>{{ project.venue | mdInline | safe }}</div>
				{% gallery project.gallery.slice(project.splitAt) %}
			</div>
			<div class="project-three__col">
				<div>{{ project.dates | mdInline | safe }}</div>
				{{ projectBody(project.text) }}
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>
{% else %}
	<article class="project">
		<header class="project-header">
			{{ projectTitle(project, projectHeading, linked) }}
			<div>{{ project.venue | mdInline | safe }}</div>
			<div>{{ project.dates | mdInline | safe }}</div>
		</header>
		<div class="project-main">
			{% gallery project.gallery, project.columns, (priority and loop.first) %}
			{{ projectBody(project.text) }}
		</div>
	</article>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
